fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"mpegts/gstmpegtssection.html#gst_mpegts_section_get_pat","fragment":"\n\tgst_mpegts_section_get_pat\n\n\n\tGstMpegts.Section.prototype.get_pat\n\n\n\tGstMpegts.Section.get_pat\n\nParses a Program Association Table (ITU H.222.0, ISO/IEC 13818-1).\nReturns the array of GstMpegtsPatProgram contained in the section.\nNote: The PAT transport_stream_id field corresponds to the\n\"subtable_extension\" field of the provided section.\nParameters:\na GstMpegtsSection of type GST_MPEGTS_SECTION_PAT\n(transfer container) (element-type GstMpegtsPatProgram) (nullable):\nThe GstMpegtsPatProgram contained in the section, or NULL if an error\nhappened or the section did not contain a valid PAT. Release with\ng_ptr_array_unref when done.\nParses a Program Association Table (ITU H.222.0, ISO/IEC 13818-1).\nReturns the array of GstMpegts.PatProgram contained in the section.\nNote: The PAT transport_stream_id field corresponds to the\n\"subtable_extension\" field of the provided section.\nParameters:\na GstMpegts.Section of type GstMpegts.SectionType.PAT\n(transfer container) (element-type GstMpegtsPatProgram) (nullable):\nThe GstMpegts.PatProgram contained in the section, or null if an error\nhappened or the section did not contain a valid PAT. Release with\ng_ptr_array_unref (not introspectable) when done.\nParses a Program Association Table (ITU H.222.0, ISO/IEC 13818-1).\nReturns the array of GstMpegts.PatProgram contained in the section.\nNote: The PAT transport_stream_id field corresponds to the\n\"subtable_extension\" field of the provided section.\nParameters:\na GstMpegts.Section of type GstMpegts.SectionType.PAT\n(transfer container) (element-type GstMpegtsPatProgram) (nullable):\nThe GstMpegts.PatProgram contained in the section, or None if an error\nhappened or the section did not contain a valid PAT. Release with\ng_ptr_array_unref (not introspectable) when done.\n"});